            "notes": "Battle Medic this round.\n\nBuild up a 10 stack with staff healing/boost for +40% Attack Speed (Blaster only) You will see the indicator next to your CD indicators. Combined with Adv. Nanobiotics you will have a 50% increase in Attack Speed.\n\nNote: If you have not built a 10 stack of Battle Medic by the time you pop your Valkyrie, it will continue to build to 10 while ulting.\n\nIf DPS is not your thing, (it should be though, big help to your team) Threads of Fate instead of Battle Medic. If you took Threads Round 3, First Responder or Renaissance.\n\nCaduceus Ex will give you greater survivability with extended beam range, and add more value to your Valkyries for the same reason.\n\nHardlight Accelerator will give you +15% WP with consistent GA use.",
